{"id":"methylenedioxybutylamphetamine","name":"Methylenedioxybutylamphetamine","form":"capsule","status":"Reference","source":"Wikidata","wikidata":"Q6823982","aliases":"MDBU","category":"Empathogen","chemicalClass":"Substituted phenethylamines","groups":[],"atc":[],"summary":"MDBU, also known as 3,4-methylenedioxy-N-butylamphetamine or as N-butyl-MDA, is a lesser-known drug. It is the N-butyl derivative of 3,4-methylenedioxyamphetamine (MDA).","summarySources":"Wikipedia","doseUnit":"","doseRows":[],"durationRows":[],"subjectiveEffects":[],"combinations":[],"citations":[],"helpfulLinks":[{"title":"Wikipedia","description":"Encyclopedia article","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Methylenedioxybutylamphetamine"},{"title":"Wikidata","description":"Structured data on Methylenedioxybutylamphetamine","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q6823982"},{"title":"PubChem","description":"Chemistry, safety and literature","url":"https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/16206440"},{"title":"維基百科","description":"zh:Encyclopedia article","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-tw/3%2C4-%E4%BA%9E%E7%94%B2%E4%BA%8C%E6%B0%A7-N-%E4%B8%81%E5%9F%BA%E8%8B%AF%E4%B8%99%E8%83%BA"},{"title":"维基百科","description":"zh:Encyclopedia article","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-cn/3%2C4-%E4%BA%9E%E7%94%B2%E4%BA%8C%E6%B0%A7-N-%E4%B8%81%E5%9F%BA%E8%8B%AF%E4%B8%99%E8%83%BA"}],"formula":"C14H21NO2","molarMass":235.32,"uses":{"routes":"Oral","figures":"Methylenedioxybutylamphetamine"},"summaryZh":"亞甲二氧丁基苯異丙胺（或稱MDBU、3,4-亞甲二氧-N-丁基苯丙胺），是一種鮮為人知的致幻劑。也是3,4-亞甲二氧基苯丙胺的N-丁基衍生物。亞歷山大·舒爾金是第一個合成出MDBU的科學家，在他的著作《PiHKAL》中，藥物的最小劑量為40毫克，藥效時間未知。MDBU對人體作用極微，甚至沒有。","summaryZhHans":"亚甲二氧丁基苯异丙胺（或称MDBU、3,4-亚甲二氧-N-丁基苯丙胺），是一种鲜为人知的致幻剂。也是3,4-亚甲二氧基苯丙胺的N-丁基衍生物。亚历山大·舒尔金是第一个合成出MDBU的科学家，在他的著作《PiHKAL》中，药物的最小剂量为40毫克，药效时间未知。MDBU对人体作用极微，甚至没有。"}